              "speaker": "Physical transformation",
              "text": "1/3 \u2014 Your height draws down as your familiar proportions give way to a compact feline body. The cat\u2019s recorded coat replaces the human outline, with whiskers and ears bringing nearby movement into sharp relief.\n\n2/3 \u2014 Hands settle into padded forepaws without human fingers. Four legs support your weight; a tail changes the balance behind you. Close scents and low sounds arrive from a viewpoint near the floor.\n\n3/3 \u2014 The change settles as Preeti. Human words remain private intentions; your outward voice can purr, meow or hiss. Feline instincts persist, but approaching others and accepting touch remain your choices. Belongings and the original body record are preserved."
